          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is saying, “One disaster after another is coming on you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It's all over. This is the end. You are finished. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The end is coming for you people who live in the land. The time is near when there will be no more celebrations at the mountain shrines, only confusion.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Probable text",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "celebrations",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "confusion",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
